  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "▶️ YouTube Channel Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Channel names by topic, in shapes that are easy to remember, say and search."
    },
    "intro": "A YouTube channel name has to work as a title, a handle and something viewers can say to a friend. This **YouTube channel name generator** builds names for five topics in the shapes that work on the platform: a mood and a subject (The Lazy Kitchen), a subject and a format (Pixel Lab), and a few in between.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "What makes a channel name work",
        "content": "<ul><li><strong>Say what the channel is about,</strong> or at least the mood of it. Viewers decide in a second whether to click.</li><li><strong>Keep it short.</strong> Since 2022 every channel has a unique @handle, and shorter handles are easier to type, say and remember.</li><li><strong>Leave room to grow.</strong> A name tied to one game or one gadget can feel narrow in a year. \"Retro Arcade TV\" can cover more than \"Minecraft Builds Daily\".</li><li><strong>Use your own name</strong> if the channel is really about you. Many of the biggest channels do.</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "heading": "Check the handle is free",
        "content": "<p>Before you settle on a name, check that the @handle is available on YouTube, and ideally on Instagram and TikTok too, so viewers find you everywhere under the same name. If your first choice is taken, a small change (adding TV, HQ or Daily) often frees it.</p><p>Starting a podcast or a blog alongside the channel? Try the <a href=\"podcast-name-generator.html\">Podcast Name Generator</a> or the <a href=\"blog-name-generator.html\">Blog Name Generator</a>.</p><p>Starting a Minecraft channel? The <a href=\"minecraft-server-name-generator.html\">Minecraft Server Name Generator</a> has SMP and server names that work as channel names too, and there are more <a href=\"../categories/minecraft-names.html\">Minecraft name generators</a> for usernames and worlds.</p>"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How do I choose a YouTube channel name?",
        "answer": "Make it short, easy to say and clear about the topic or mood, then check the @handle is free on YouTube and other social platforms."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can two YouTube channels have the same name?",
        "answer": "Display names can repeat, but @handles are unique, so check the handle you want is available."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can I use these names for my channel?",
        "answer": "Yes, free and with no credit needed."
